  "description": "Config-driven LLM model catalog + router, providers (Azure OpenAI Responses, OpenAI Responses, OpenAI-compatible endpoints, Gemini native), per-hop completion logging with replayable vision images, failover + alerting, tolerant one-shot JSON completions, a provider-agnostic streaming agent loop with function tools, and the conversation wire: frames v2, a nonterminal turn session with outcome-aware SSE finality, prebuilt question/follow-up tools, and scope-generic attachment contracts — built on Microsoft.Extensions.AI.",
  "id": "Polycrest.AgentKit",
