  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0: the conversation kit — the one sanctioned pre-1.0 break. Frames v2 (kit-owned wire vocabulary, conformance-tested from C# and TS against shared fixtures), AgentTurnSession/AgentTurnOutcome (nonterminal frames + explicit outcome; terminal success only after the host finalizer commits), the narrow ASP.NET AgentTurnSse writer (Drain|Cancel disconnect semantics, distinct write/turn/finalization tokens) and multipart attachment endpoint helper, prebuilt ask_question/ask_questions/suggest_followups tools with AgentQuestionHistory, AgentTool.DisplayLabel, IAgentAttachmentStore<TScope>, and multimodal history parts. Ships together with @polycrestlabs/agentkit-ui 0.4.0.",
